~ start
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]Is this... [wait=0.8]the place Mateo wanted to show me?[/shake]
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]So dark...[/shake]
=> END

~ signage
Danilo: This way... [wait=0.6]A chapel, they say?
=> END

~ exploration_chat
do BuzzManager.start_buzz()
Danilo: ...
- Open the phone => chat_unknown_sender
=> END

~ chat_unknown_sender
do BuzzManager.stop_buzz()
do Hud.show_phone_with_unknown_sender()
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "Danilo... narating mo na ang lugar na ito.")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]Danilo... you’ve reached this place.
=> chat_unknown_sender_2

~ chat_unknown_sender_2
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "Lumapit ka... baka makita mo kung ano ang hinahanap mo.")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]Come closer... you might see what you’re looking for.
=> END

~ lighter_found
Danilo: A lighter... maybe this will come in handy.
=> END

~ explore_cabinet
Danilo: An old cabinet... locked? Seems like it hasn’t been opened in years.
=> END

~ explore_candle
Danilo: Candles... all covered in dust. Haven’t been lit in a long time.
=> END

~ explore_mateo_things
Danilo: Some belongings... but whose are these?
Danilo: Slippers and clothes... looks like someone slept here.
Danilo: On the wall... full of scribbles and letters.
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]???[/shake]
Danilo: ...These drawings???
Danilo: Are these the three of us?
Danilo: Me, [wait=0.5]Wendy, [wait=0.5]and... Mateo.
Danilo: So this old chapel... this is what he wanted to show me before...
Danilo: Mateo, this place is full of your memories...
Danilo: Where are you now... Mateo...?
Danilo: I’ll find you... I promise.
=> END

~ after_explore_all
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]It’s so dark...[/shake] I should light the candles to see the whole place.
do ObjectiveManager.add_objective(scene_objectives[3]["ID"], scene_objectives[3]["text"])
=> END

~ candle_ignited
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "Iba-iba ang pagkakaayos ng mga kandila. Pumili ka ng unang kandila ayon sa gusto mo.")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]The candles are disordered. You may choose which one to start with...
=> candle_ignited_1

~ candle_ignited_1
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "Tapos, sindihan mo lahat ng natitirang kandila sa tamang ayos...")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]Then, light all the remaining candles in the correct order...
=> candle_ignited_2

~ candle_ignited_2
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "Huwag kang magkakamali.")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5]Don't make a mistake.
do Hud.phone_outro()
=> END

~ wrong_candle
Danilo: This isn’t the right candle...
=> END

~ all_candles_lit_up
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]??????[/shake]
Danilo: What was that?[wait=0.5] Did something just make a sound?
Danilo: The... cabinet?[wait=0.5] Did it... just [shake rate=20 level=10]open on its own?[/shake]
=> END

~ correct_old_cabinet
Danilo: What’s this?
Danilo: Paper? [wait=0.5]Wait...
Danilo: Is this... one of Mateo’s missing diary pages?
Danilo: I have to take it...
=> END

~ wrong_old_cabinet
Danilo: I checked... but it’s empty.
=> END

~ after_cabinets_dialogue
Danilo: Seems there’s nothing else here... Maybe I can leave now.
=> END

~ while_shadow_ghost_forward
Danilo: !!!
=> END

~ after_shadow_ghost_forward
Danilo: [speed=1][shake rate=100.0 level=10]????????????????????[/shake]
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]WHAT WAS THAT?![/shake]
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]WHAT... WHAT DID I JUST SEE?![/shake]
Danilo: ... ... ...
Danilo: Calm down, Danilo... just calm down...
Danilo: I-I need to get out of here... before something happens to me.
=> END

~ back_to_dark_forest
Danilo: I have to leave this place...
Danilo: But where to go? Ah... the cliff.
Danilo: I have to keep moving.
=> END
